## 🛠️ Troubleshooting

| Problem | Likely Cause |
|---------|--------------|
| Remediation fails on `Add-PrinterDriver` | The driver isn't in the driver store, or the name doesn't exactly match. |
| Detection never reports compliant | Variables differ between the two scripts, or the driver name has a typo. |
| Printer installs but won't print | Wrong IP, printer offline, firewall blocking port 9100, or the class driver isn't compatible with the model. |
| Printer only appears for one user | Script was set to run with logged-on credentials instead of SYSTEM. |

