## ✅ Requirements

- Windows 10 / Windows 11
- PowerShell 5.1 or later (with the built-in `PrintManagement` module)
- Administrator / SYSTEM privileges
- Network connectivity to the printer
- Microsoft Intune with Remediations licensing (for Intune deployment)

